meta {
  name: abha-login
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Log in to an ABHA that exists (M1, journey 5). One entry point for 4 hints.

  | `hint` | `login_id` | `otp_system` |
  |---|---|---|
  | `mobile` | 10 digits | `abdm` only |
  | `abha-number` | 14 digits | `abdm` or `aadhaar` |
  | `abha-address` | `name@abdm` | `abdm` or `aadhaar` |
  | `aadhaar` | 12 digits | `aadhaar` only |

  Only the `mobile` hint can give more than one account. Use "Select account" then.
}
